  circumstances that are equally important  equally fundamental to justice not  harming other people or ourselves and  make  sure that the common interests are  actually being protected preserved  fulfilled so those provide us with  guidelines for for figuring out when we  should and when we shouldn't keep  promises the last thing to say about  this is that in real situations this is  often difficult and we often have  feelings of guilt or other emotions  involved but if we apply these sort of  rules I think it's much easier to see  our way through those tricky situations
 

